### Secure Strategy 1: Environment Variables Alone (Development)

**Setup:** Secrets set at container orchestration level (Kubernetes Secrets, Docker Swarm secrets, Cloud Run secrets)

```javascript
// ✅ SECURE PATTERN 1 - Environment Variable Only
